('srd35_magic_universal_solvent','Universal solvent','magic_item',50,50,'This substance has the unique property of being able to dissolve sovereign glue and tanglefoot bags. Applying the solvent is a standard action.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"50 gp","roll_result":"02","raw_table_row":["02","Universal solvent","50 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_elixir_of_love','Elixir of love','magic_item',150,150,'This sweet-tasting liquid causes the character drinking it to become charmed with the first creature she sees after consuming the draft (as charm person—the drinker must be a humanoid of Medium or smaller size, Will DC 14 negates). The charm effects wear off in 1d3 hours.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"150 gp","roll_result":"03","raw_table_row":["03","Elixir of love","150 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_unguent_of_timelessness','Unguent of timelessness','magic_item',150,150,'When applied to any matter that was once alive this ointment allows that substance to resist the passage of time. Each year of actual time affects the substance as if only a day had passed. The coated object gains a +1 resistance bonus on all saving throws. The unguent never wears off, although it can be magically removed (by dispelling the effect, for instance). One flask contains enough material to coat eight Medium or smaller objects. A Large object counts as two Medium objects, and a Huge object counts as two Large objects.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"150 gp","roll_result":"04","raw_table_row":["04","Unguent of timelessness","150 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_feather_token_fan','Feather token, fan','magic_item',200,200,'Listed in Table: Minor Wondrous Items; market price 200 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"200 gp","roll_result":"05","raw_table_row":["05","Feather token, fan","200 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_dust_of_tracelessness','Dust of tracelessness','magic_item',250,250,'This normal-seeming dust is actually a magic powder that can conceal the passage of its possessor and his companions. Tossing a handful of this dust into the air causes a chamber of up to 100 square feet of floor space to become as dusty, dirty, and cobweb-laden as if it had been abandoned and disused for a decade.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"06","raw_table_row":["06","Dust of tracelessness","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_elixir_of_hiding','Elixir of hiding','magic_item',250,250,'A character drinking this liquid gains an intuitive ability to hide (+10 competence bonus on Hide checks for 1 hour).','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"07","raw_table_row":["07","Elixir of hiding","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_elixir_of_sneaking','Elixir of sneaking','magic_item',250,250,'This draught of liquid grants the drinker the ability to walk softly and dampens sound around her slightly, granting a +10 competence bonus on Move Silently checks for 1 hour.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"08","raw_table_row":["08","Elixir of sneaking","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_elixir_of_swimming','Elixir of swimming','magic_item',250,250,'This elixir bestows swimming ability. An almost imperceptible magic sheath surrounds the drinker, allowing him to glide through the water easily (+10 competence bonus on Swim checks for 1 hour).','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"09","raw_table_row":["09","Elixir of swimming","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_elixir_of_vision','Elixir of vision','magic_item',250,250,'Drinking this elixir grants the imbiber the ability to notice acute details with great accuracy (+10 competence bonus on Search checks for 1 hour).','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"10","raw_table_row":["10","Elixir of vision","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_silversheen','Silversheen','magic_item',250,250,'This substance can be applied to a weapon as a standard action. It will give the weapon the properties of alchemical silver for 1 hour, replacing the properties of any other special material it might have. One vial will coat a single melee weapon or 20 units of ammunition.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Minor Wondrous Items","market_price":"250 gp","roll_result":"11","raw_table_row":["11","Silversheen","250 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
